{"name":"Magic Lamp","hex":"#c2a260","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"magic lamp","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An oil lamp that can be rubbed in order to summon a genie who grants wishes."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/magic_lamp"}],"entries":[{"title":"Magic Lamp (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Magic Lamp is a 2008 Indian Malayalam-language Comedy drama film directed by K. K. Haridas and produced by Cherupuzha Jose. The film stars Jayaram in four roles, with Meena, Sangeetha, Divya Unni and Kalabhavan Mani appears in lead roles. The film has musical score by Ouseppachan. Magic Lamp is a multi-starrer comedy flick."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b9/Magic-Lamp-2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magic_Lamp_(film)","wikidata":"Q18127651"},{"title":"Aladdin","blocks":[{"text":"Aladdin is a Middle-Eastern folk tale. It is one of the best-known tales associated with One Thousand and One Nights, despite not being part of the original text; it was added by the Frenchman Antoine Galland, based on a folk tale that he heard from the Syrian storyteller Hanna Diyab."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Alad.jpg/330px-Alad.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aladdin","wikidata":"Q209515"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Robida_-_Aladin_illustration_page1.jpeg/500px-Robida_-_Aladin_illustration_page1.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Robida_-_Aladin_illustration_page1.jpeg/1280px-Robida_-_Aladin_illustration_page1.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Robida_-_A